1
00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:14,580
I've really run out of options.

2
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:17,480
Please, I'm begging you.

3
00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:19,300
You're not just dealing with me.

4
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:22,180
You're facing the Party and the people, you know?

5
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:25,340
If you don't help me this time,

6
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:28,980
you won't be dealing with just me, either.

7
00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:32,760
What do you mean?

8
00:00:33,480 --> 00:00:34,280
Are you threatening me?

9
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:35,520
No.

10
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:37,080
How could I?

11
00:00:39,620 --> 00:00:41,100
I saved you once before.

12
00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:42,660
This time,

13
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:43,760
just consider it paying me back.

14
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:44,380
Can you do that?

15
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:46,460
By urging you to turn yourself in now,

16
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:48,180
I am actually saving you.

17
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:49,200
Don't you get it?

18
00:00:50,760 --> 00:00:52,180
Geng Qing, oh Geng Qing...

19
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:54,560
Can't you stop being so naive?

20
00:00:54,940 --> 00:00:55,740
You have no idea

21
00:00:55,740 --> 00:00:57,680
what you're about to face.

22
00:00:58,280 --> 00:01:00,400
This ledger is a hot potato.

23
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:01,200
Can't you just

24
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:02,840
keep yourself out of trouble?

25
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:04,100
Let me tell you this too.

26
00:01:04,580 --> 00:01:05,780
At the Discipline and Inspection Committee,

27
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:07,920
we constantly face all kinds of pressure.

28
00:01:08,320 --> 00:01:09,320
If I feared trouble,

29
00:01:09,740 --> 00:01:10,980
I wouldn't be in this line of work.

30
00:01:12,480 --> 00:01:14,160
I could save you once,

31
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:18,120
but I might not be able to save you again.

32
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:21,540
I hear you loud and clear.

33
00:01:23,740 --> 00:01:24,540
Go back

34
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:27,280
and tell whoever is behind you:

35
00:01:27,420 --> 00:01:28,520
I, Geng Qing,

36
00:01:28,980 --> 00:01:30,120
am standing right here.

37
00:01:30,620 --> 00:01:31,820
Bring it on.

38
00:01:32,780 --> 00:01:34,140
I'll be waiting.

39
00:01:37,440 --> 00:01:38,920
Then we have nothing left to talk about.

40
00:01:39,580 --> 00:01:40,960
Those on different paths

41
00:01:42,520 --> 00:01:43,740
cannot walk together.

42
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:46,840
Fine.

43
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:49,360
Looks like

44
00:01:51,020 --> 00:01:52,660
this is as far as we go.

45
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:57,080
Not necessarily.

46
00:01:58,460 --> 00:02:00,220
You can still choose to come with me.

47
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:05,800
Let's go our separate ways.

48
00:02:08,220 --> 00:02:09,040
Qingbo.

49
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:10,120
Qingbo!

50
00:02:34,220 --> 00:02:34,960
Brother,

51
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:36,040
here's your cut.

52
00:02:37,020 --> 00:02:38,120
Geng Qing,

53
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:39,940
since you've shown no loyalty,

54
00:02:40,480 --> 00:02:42,280
don't blame me for turning on you.

55
00:02:43,300 --> 00:02:45,700
The law and the underworld are after me,

56
00:02:45,700 --> 00:02:47,200
backing me into a corner.

57
00:02:47,700 --> 00:02:48,900
Du Qingbo,

58
00:02:48,900 --> 00:02:50,260
are you the one screwing with me?

59
00:02:50,260 --> 00:02:52,280
How could that be, Boss Jia?

60
00:02:52,700 --> 00:02:54,260
You know how close we are.

61
00:02:58,400 --> 00:02:59,920
I know how powerful Young Master Qin is.

62
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:01,780
Let me off the hook this time.

63
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:03,640
All the profits from Jianzhou Xiba...

64
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:04,960
I'll give 80% to Young Master Qin.

65
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:06,860
I'm begging him to help me, please.

66
00:03:06,860 --> 00:03:08,120
Boss Jia,

67
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,880
you should know this.

68
00:03:09,880 --> 00:03:10,880
Young Master Qin and I...

69
00:03:10,880 --> 00:03:13,200
we never mess with anything illegal.

70
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,480
But then again,

71
00:03:16,480 --> 00:03:17,820
since we're friends,

72
00:03:18,620 --> 00:03:19,900
after you go to prison,

73
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:21,480
as for your family,

74
00:03:21,980 --> 00:03:23,860
I'll help settle them in the US.

75
00:03:24,140 --> 00:03:25,420
And I guarantee your company

76
00:03:25,420 --> 00:03:26,620
will keep running as usual.

77
00:03:26,620 --> 00:03:27,680
As for your boys,

78
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:28,800
I'll take good care of them too.

79
00:03:30,220 --> 00:03:31,100
You...

80
00:03:32,460 --> 00:03:33,940
Would you really be so kind?

81
00:03:35,540 --> 00:03:36,140
Of course.

82
00:03:36,700 --> 00:03:37,780
But in return,

83
00:03:37,980 --> 00:03:39,880
I need a favor from you as well.

84
00:03:40,820 --> 00:03:43,020
When you surrender to the
Discipline and Inspection Committee,

85
00:03:43,180 --> 00:03:44,440
just tell them

86
00:03:44,620 --> 00:03:46,920
you have proof of Geng Qing's corruption.

87
00:03:49,380 --> 00:03:50,920
Frame Geng Qing?

88
00:03:52,260 --> 00:03:53,620
Isn't he your brother?

89
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:56,520
I have plenty of brothers.

90
00:03:56,520 --> 00:03:58,000
Aren't you one of them too?

91
00:04:01,540 --> 00:04:02,700
Du Qingbo,

92
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:04,620
stop playing games with me.

93
00:04:05,180 --> 00:04:06,140
You reported me

94
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:08,560
and had people make anonymous calls to me...

95
00:04:08,780 --> 00:04:11,060
wasn't it just to force me to frame Geng Qing?

96
00:04:11,340 --> 00:04:12,220
Right?

97
00:04:14,740 --> 00:04:16,060
Well, that's why they say

98
00:04:16,460 --> 00:04:18,500
you're a smart man, Boss Jia.

99
00:04:19,260 --> 00:04:21,160
Dealing with the Discipline and Inspection Committee

100
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:23,040
requires someone as clever as you.

101
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:24,360
Dream on!

102
00:04:25,200 --> 00:04:26,360
Am I crazy?

103
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:27,880
Why would I work with you?

104
00:04:27,880 --> 00:04:28,800
Listen here, Jia.

105
00:04:30,620 --> 00:04:32,420
Reasoning with you nicely doesn't work, does it?

106
00:04:33,080 --> 00:04:33,660
Fine.

107
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:35,860
You can leave right now.

108
00:04:36,340 --> 00:04:38,600
The anonymous letter detailing your crimes

109
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:40,180
is already on its way to the
Discipline and Inspection Committee.

110
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:42,560
The evidence against you is rock solid.

111
00:04:42,960 --> 00:04:44,460
You're going behind bars no matter what.

112
00:04:45,740 --> 00:04:46,740
When that happens,

113
00:04:47,060 --> 00:04:48,260
your wife,

114
00:04:48,440 --> 00:04:49,520
your child,

115
00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:51,120
and your company...

116
00:04:51,880 --> 00:04:54,040
won't be looked after by me.

117
00:04:56,500 --> 00:04:57,460
You...

118
00:04:59,300 --> 00:05:00,100
What?

119
00:05:00,620 --> 00:05:01,680
Want to get violent?

120
00:05:11,220 --> 00:05:12,140
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

121
00:05:12,140 --> 00:05:12,820
Mr. Du,

122
00:05:13,300 --> 00:05:14,560
I was too impulsive just now.

123
00:05:15,660 --> 00:05:16,780
I lost my head.

124
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:19,800
You said earlier

125
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:21,280
that if I do as you say,

126
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:23,320
my family

127
00:05:23,320 --> 00:05:25,040
and the men under me...

128
00:05:26,520 --> 00:05:28,160
you'll take good care of them all,

129
00:05:28,580 --> 00:05:29,500
right?

130
00:05:38,680 --> 00:05:40,120
You make the sacrifice,

131
00:05:40,780 --> 00:05:42,300
and everyone else gets to be happy.

132
00:05:53,020 --> 00:05:53,780
All right.

133
00:05:53,780 --> 00:05:55,220
I'll do as you say.

134
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:57,100
Hello, Jianzhou Discipline and Inspection Committee.

135
00:05:57,100 --> 00:05:58,160
My name is Jia Dongping.

136
00:05:58,460 --> 00:06:00,820
I want to report Geng Qing for bribery under my real name.

137
00:06:01,940 --> 00:06:04,960
You're saying Jia Dongping reported Geng Qing under his real name?

138
00:06:04,960 --> 00:06:06,420
And reported him to multiple agencies?

139
00:06:06,420 --> 00:06:07,940
Yes, to multiple agencies.

140
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:10,100
He even explicitly stated

141
00:06:10,100 --> 00:06:12,100
that he sent materials to the Provincial Discipline and Inspection Committee.

142
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:16,040
Then handle it strictly by the rules.

143
00:06:16,380 --> 00:06:17,840
Find out the truth as soon as possible.

144
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,040
Secretary Luo,

145
00:06:19,400 --> 00:06:20,560
if someone is

146
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:22,680
deliberately smearing our comrade,

147
00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:24,340
we will never let Comrade Geng Qing

148
00:06:24,340 --> 00:06:25,640
be wronged in any way.

149
00:06:27,820 --> 00:06:29,200
But if

150
00:06:29,600 --> 00:06:31,200
this turns out to be true,

151
00:06:32,340 --> 00:06:33,140
Secretary,

152
00:06:33,760 --> 00:06:34,900
we can't tolerate it either.

153
00:06:34,900 --> 00:06:36,900
Of course. If it's true, show zero tolerance.

154
00:06:37,160 --> 00:06:39,140
Report any progress to me immediately.

155
00:06:39,460 --> 00:06:40,220
Understood.

156
00:06:51,440 --> 00:06:52,960
To think I need to drink this now.

157
00:06:54,240 --> 00:06:56,040
Still think you're a young guy?

158
00:06:56,400 --> 00:06:57,600
Refill it with warm water when you're done.

159
00:06:58,280 --> 00:06:59,280
Well,

160
00:06:59,440 --> 00:07:00,760
if I finish it today,

161
00:07:01,060 --> 00:07:02,120
will there be more tomorrow?

162
00:07:13,060 --> 00:07:13,680
Hello?

163
00:07:13,760 --> 00:07:14,580
Director Chen.

164
00:07:17,940 --> 00:07:18,940
You wanted to see me?

165
00:07:22,260 --> 00:07:23,540
Someone filed a real-name report

166
00:07:23,780 --> 00:07:24,980
that five years ago,

167
00:07:24,980 --> 00:07:26,320
while stationed at the Third Bureau

168
00:07:26,320 --> 00:07:27,840
of the Housing Construction Group,

169
00:07:27,980 --> 00:07:29,480
you accepted service fees.

170
00:07:29,980 --> 00:07:31,000
Comrade Geng Qing,

171
00:07:31,440 --> 00:07:32,600
I expect you to

172
00:07:32,820 --> 00:07:34,420
be completely truthful.

173
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:39,720
Bro,

174
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:40,860
this is your share.

175
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:43,240
What's this?

176
00:07:45,200 --> 00:07:46,520
A standard service allowance.

177
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:48,660
Not much, only 2,500.

178
00:07:49,080 --> 00:07:50,280
Are you kidding me?

179
00:07:51,180 --> 00:07:52,700
It's the bureau's standard rate.

180
00:07:52,700 --> 00:07:54,780
A high-temperature subsidy since it's hot.

181
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:56,200
On our project,

182
00:07:56,200 --> 00:07:57,380
everyone gets one.

183
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:58,700
Everyone gets one?

184
00:07:59,720 --> 00:08:00,580
Who else did you give it to?

185
00:08:00,700 --> 00:08:01,500
Well...

186
00:08:02,960 --> 00:08:04,580
Do you know what my job is?

187
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:05,900
Take it back.

188
00:08:09,320 --> 00:08:10,600
I didn't take the money back then.

189
00:08:10,940 --> 00:08:12,820
Du Qingbo said he would return it for me.

190
00:08:12,820 --> 00:08:14,880
Then why didn't you return it yourself?

191
00:08:14,880 --> 00:08:16,640
How could I return what I never accepted?

192
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:19,620
By discipline rules,

193
00:08:19,620 --> 00:08:21,360
you should have reported it immediately.

194
00:08:21,780 --> 00:08:22,580
Yes.

195
00:08:25,340 --> 00:08:26,340
Why are you here so late?

196
00:08:26,760 --> 00:08:28,120
Yanyan is already asleep.

197
00:08:29,960 --> 00:08:31,680
Had a few drinks with clients.

198
00:08:32,900 --> 00:08:34,300
You reek of alcohol.

199
00:08:37,460 --> 00:08:38,340
Listen to me.

200
00:08:38,720 --> 00:08:40,280
Let Yanyan sleep here tonight.

201
00:08:40,280 --> 00:08:41,940
You've had too much to drink to take her home.

202
00:08:44,540 --> 00:08:45,360
As for you,

203
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:46,220
sleep with me.

204
00:08:46,540 --> 00:08:47,340
How about that?

205
00:08:50,640 --> 00:08:52,560
Since Yanyan is staying here,

206
00:08:54,220 --> 00:08:56,180
I'll head to another gathering shortly.

207
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:58,240
You've had so much to drink, and you're still going?

208
00:08:59,260 --> 00:09:00,600
We've had this scheduled for days.

209
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:01,700
I have to show up.

210
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:08,720
I know starting a business isn't easy,

211
00:09:08,940 --> 00:09:10,080
so take it easy on yourself.

212
00:09:13,920 --> 00:09:14,780
By the way,

213
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:19,240
Manager Zhou from the Third Bureau of the

214
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,020
Housing Construction Group

215
00:09:21,280 --> 00:09:22,320
asked me to pass this to you.

216
00:09:25,060 --> 00:09:25,980
What's going on?

217
00:09:26,620 --> 00:09:28,060
They're going through you now?

218
00:09:28,660 --> 00:09:30,480
Do you think I can accept this money?

219
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:35,240
I knew you couldn't take it.

220
00:09:36,260 --> 00:09:37,420
I already returned it for you.

221
00:09:41,060 --> 00:09:42,100
Hey, about this...

222
00:09:42,300 --> 00:09:43,380
You won't report it, will you?

223
00:09:44,340 --> 00:09:45,860
Isn't that obvious?

224
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:47,640
Of course I'll report it.

225
00:09:49,160 --> 00:09:50,500
You can't report it.

226
00:09:50,500 --> 00:09:51,740
Report what? Don't do that.

227
00:09:52,100 --> 00:09:54,080
Reporting it ruins the Third Bureau's appraisal.

228
00:09:54,300 --> 00:09:56,260
Manager Zhou might even lose his job.

229
00:09:56,920 --> 00:09:59,160
Did you ever consider it could cost me mine?

230
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:01,400
But you didn't take it!

231
00:10:01,880 --> 00:10:03,400
I returned the money for you.

232
00:10:03,580 --> 00:10:04,580
Returning it isn't enough.

233
00:10:05,300 --> 00:10:06,820
Even in a case like this,

234
00:10:07,180 --> 00:10:08,080
we have strict rules.

235
00:10:08,080 --> 00:10:08,820
It must be reported.

236
00:10:11,140 --> 00:10:12,400
Manager Zhou's mother

237
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:14,940
has been bedridden for three years.

238
00:10:15,740 --> 00:10:16,860
If he loses his job,

239
00:10:16,860 --> 00:10:18,540
his entire family will starve.

240
00:10:23,440 --> 00:10:24,280
This matter...

241
00:10:24,280 --> 00:10:26,320
Nobody knows except the two of us.

242
00:10:28,740 --> 00:10:29,860
Let's just leave it at that.

243
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:31,280
I returned the money for you, okay?

244
00:10:34,020 --> 00:10:35,100
Back then,

245
00:10:35,100 --> 00:10:36,820
I did go to verify it.

246
00:10:36,820 --> 00:10:39,260
Zhou Zhiyuan's mother was indeed bedridden.

247
00:10:39,680 --> 00:10:41,680
So out of sympathy, I...

248
00:10:46,460 --> 00:10:48,660
According to the Third Bureau's records,

249
00:10:48,860 --> 00:10:49,900
and their report,

250
00:10:50,140 --> 00:10:52,540
you worked there for six months back then,

251
00:10:52,540 --> 00:10:53,900
2,500 each month,

252
00:10:54,080 --> 00:10:55,480
totaling 15,000,

253
00:10:55,480 --> 00:10:56,860
collected every single month.

254
00:10:59,780 --> 00:11:01,120
Then this is a serious matter.

255
00:11:01,680 --> 00:11:03,400
Can you explain it clearly now?

256
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:11,800
Five years ago... five years ago,

257
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:13,260
it seems...

258
00:11:13,260 --> 00:11:14,660
I think something like that did happen.

259
00:11:15,400 --> 00:11:17,300
Back then, it was...

260
00:11:17,540 --> 00:11:20,180
Manager Zhou from the Third Bureau,

261
00:11:20,680 --> 00:11:21,520
named Zhou Zhiyuan.

262
00:11:21,520 --> 00:11:23,220
Every time, he asked me to pass it on.

263
00:11:24,280 --> 00:11:25,440
Of course,

264
00:11:25,880 --> 00:11:27,920
I must also admit my own mistake.

265
00:11:28,480 --> 00:11:30,400
I shouldn't have handled that money.

266
00:11:31,980 --> 00:11:32,740
This time,

267
00:11:32,740 --> 00:11:34,040
I have truly realized that.

268
00:11:35,820 --> 00:11:37,300
Here, Comrade Jianguo, have some water.

269
00:11:37,500 --> 00:11:38,040
Thank you, thank you.

270
00:11:38,040 --> 00:11:39,020
You've worked hard lately.

271
00:11:39,020 --> 00:11:39,700
No, not at all.

272
00:11:39,700 --> 00:11:40,780
It's my duty.

273
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:42,820
Secretary,

274
00:11:43,480 --> 00:11:44,900
the Third Bureau of the Housing Construction Group

275
00:11:44,900 --> 00:11:46,660
did have this labor expense on record.

276
00:11:46,660 --> 00:11:47,400
But as to whether

277
00:11:47,400 --> 00:11:49,300
Comrade Geng Qing actually took it,

278
00:11:49,300 --> 00:11:50,780
we still need to investigate further.

279
00:11:51,420 --> 00:11:52,420
However...

280
00:11:53,260 --> 00:11:54,200
However what? Speak up.

281
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:55,240
Don't beat around the bush.

282
00:11:55,660 --> 00:11:56,580
However,

283
00:11:56,780 --> 00:11:57,980
back then, Geng Qing

284
00:11:57,980 --> 00:11:59,400
indeed failed to report it.

285
00:12:01,520 --> 00:12:03,840
Then handle it strictly by the rules.

286
00:12:09,180 --> 00:12:10,180
Comrade Jianguo,

287
00:12:11,620 --> 00:12:13,660
when we encounter an issue,

288
00:12:13,660 --> 00:12:15,060
we must exercise proper discretion.

289
00:12:16,140 --> 00:12:17,540
We shouldn't blow things out of proportion,

290
00:12:17,540 --> 00:12:18,740
but if there's a problem,

291
00:12:19,540 --> 00:12:20,780
we must be realistic

292
00:12:20,940 --> 00:12:21,820
and handle it strictly.

293
00:12:22,060 --> 00:12:22,860
Understood.

294
00:12:27,180 --> 00:12:28,200
As for the matter,

295
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:29,420
we will continue our investigation.

296
00:12:30,100 --> 00:12:31,820
However, according to organizational procedures,

297
00:12:32,220 --> 00:12:33,660
during the verification period,

298
00:12:33,900 --> 00:12:35,760
you are required to cooperate with the inquiry.

299
00:12:36,760 --> 00:12:38,160
It has been decided

300
00:12:38,620 --> 00:12:41,740
to suspend Comrade Geng Qing from all task force duties.

301
00:12:42,180 --> 00:12:42,980
Sir!

302
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:45,760
I don't believe Comrade Geng Qing would do such a thing.

303
00:12:46,100 --> 00:12:47,540
Someone is clearly slinging mud!

304
00:12:47,540 --> 00:12:48,840
We all know it deep down.

305
00:12:50,340 --> 00:12:51,140
Lin Lan.

306
00:12:51,780 --> 00:12:53,640
You're a veteran police officer.

307
00:12:53,640 --> 00:12:55,400
How can you say something like that?

308
00:12:56,060 --> 00:12:58,040
Others may resort to underhanded tricks,

309
00:12:58,040 --> 00:13:00,900
but we must stick to our principles.

310
00:13:02,460 --> 00:13:03,520
Comrade Lin Lan,

311
00:13:04,260 --> 00:13:06,800
our task force still has work to do.

312
00:13:07,260 --> 00:13:10,060
Don't forget you're the deputy head of the task force.

313
00:13:10,280 --> 00:13:11,440
Do you understand?

314
00:13:12,460 --> 00:13:13,260
Understood.

315
00:13:17,840 --> 00:13:19,740
Regarding Comrade Geng Qing's issue,

316
00:13:19,740 --> 00:13:21,560
although the amount involved is small,

317
00:13:22,040 --> 00:13:23,600
it serves as a profound warning.

318
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:25,840
Regardless of whether it's true,

319
00:13:25,840 --> 00:13:28,620
we strictly will not tolerate such issues

320
00:13:28,620 --> 00:13:31,740
happening among our disciplinary inspection personnel.

321
00:13:37,520 --> 00:13:38,540
Comrade Geng Qing,

322
00:13:39,100 --> 00:13:40,540
effective immediately,

323
00:13:41,020 --> 00:13:42,920
please suspend your current duties.
